                <articleBody jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="company/components/text" textIsRich="true"
                    text="&lt;h2&gt;Train Hard, Sleep Harder&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sleep is when your body adapts to training. Skimp on it and progress stalls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Aim for 7-9 hours&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Keep a consistent schedule&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dark, cool room; no screens late&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Better sleep beats another supplement, every time.&lt;/p&gt;"/>
